    "title": "Section of Millers Lane to close in Goochland for pipe replacement - NewsBreak",
    "text": "GOOCHLAND COUNTY, Va. (WRIC) — A section of Millers Lane is set to close in Goochland in the coming weeks for a pipe replacement project. The section of Millers Lane between Manakin Road and River Road West will close starting Wednesday, Aug. 13 at 8 a.m. through Thursday, Aug. 14 at 5 p.m., according to a release from the Virginia Department of Transportation (VDOT) Although homeowners will still have access to their property throughout the project, drivers are urged to use the following detour: Those with questions about the project can contact VDOT’s customer service center at 800-367-7623. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WRIC ABC 8News.",
